/T (We select and train over 40 local facilitators, who are either college or high school graduates. These facilitators are provided with mobile phones equipped with a practice application. Using this app, they conduct practice sessions with groups of 20 to 40 students at a time. These sessions reinforce the concepts being taught, and the facilitators assist students whenever they encounter difficulties. This personalized and differentiated learning approach combines the advantages of technology with the essential human touch.)
