903 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 345 0 R
/T (Solve-with-Bharat has given us strong evidence that structured practice can improve foundational numeracy. It has also given us a clearer view of what makes the model work. The Community Facilitator matters. The amount of practice matters. The way practice is organised matters. And the school context matters. When a model works in one setting, that does not automatically mean it will work in another. That is why the pilots are important.)
/E (Solve-with-Bharat has given us strong evidence that structured practice can improve foundational numeracy. It has also given us a clearer view of what makes the model work. The Community Facilitator matters. The amount of practice matters. The way practice is organised matters. And the school context matters. When a model works in one setting, that does not automatically mean it will work in another. That is why the pilots are important.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
